        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Pocket Door Privacy Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Baldwin this sliding pocket door privacy lock is available in 7 beautiful finishes. Built to last, all the component parts are made primarily of solid forge brass, accurately machined for a lifetime of smooth operation. Built in flush edge pull provides convenient in pocket door applications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned with heavy gauge steel case for maximum strength.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith every detail, Baldwin hardware sends a message of quality and style\u0014 throughout the life of your door. For an investment in your home that will last for many years to come.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy Lock:</b> Latches and can be locked for privacy. Can be locked from the inside by a turn piece. Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via a small hole to insert the included simple release tool. Privacy locks do not offer security.  Click here for a secure <a href=\"/products/keyed-sliding-or-pocket-door-lock-baldwin-8590-260\">Keyed Lock Pocket Door Lock</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img  src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/baldwin-pocket-lock.gif?v=1704354769\" border=\"0\" width=\"590\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Baldwin Pocket Door Locks\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching <a href=\"/products/keyed-sliding-or-pocket-door-lock-baldwin-8590-260\"><b>Keyed Lock Pocket Door Lock</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Sliding or Pocket Door Privacy Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Latch Case Height: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Case Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Case Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Case Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Edge Face Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Optional 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/8580.pdf?v=1691094970\" target=\"new\"><b>Baldwin 8580 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>This has been Discontinued by the Manufacturer.</b> Please see <a href=\"/collections/baldwin-sliding-door-hardware\">for Baldwin Sliding Pocket Door Hardware</a>\r\n</p>",
